    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Swap activity",
      "description": "Pages moving to and from swap. A non-zero swap-out on a machine this size is the early warning that memory is short — long before anything is killed. Production has 2 GiB of swap configured and has never touched it; the point of the panel is to notice the day that changes.",
